comment_body:
I have generated a clean, minimal "Proof of Concept" JSON workflow:

**Minimal Bug Report Workflow:**
```json
{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": { "responseMode": "responseNode" },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 80],
      "id": "chat-trigger-received",
      "name": "When chat message received"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "maxIterations": 4,
        "returnIntermediateSteps": true,
        "systemMessage": "When the user's message starts with TEST: 1. Extract the arithmetic expression. 2. Call the Calculator tool exactly once. 3. Do not calculate it yourself."
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [480, 80],
      "id": "ai-agent",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, 280],
      "id": "ollama-chat-model",
      "name": "Ollama Chat Model"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolCalculator",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 480],
      "id": "calculator-tool",
      "name": "Calculator"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "sendAndWait",
        "approvalType": "approveAndDisapprove",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatHitlTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, 480],
      "id": "chat-human-review",
      "name": "Chat - Human Review"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When chat message received": {
      "main": [ [ { "node": "AI Agent", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ]
    },
    "AI Agent": {
      "ai_languageModel": [ [ { "node": "Ollama Chat Model", "type": "ai_languageModel", "index": 0 } ] ],
      "ai_tool": [ [ { "node": "Chat - Human Review", "type": "ai_tool", "index": 0 } ] ]
    },
    "Chat - Human Review": {
      "ai_tool": [ [ { "node": "Calculator", "type": "ai_tool", "index": 0 } ] ]
    }
  }
}

@Joffcom Windows Server 2022 Standard

In test environment both built-in and n8n-nodes-ldap@0.1.10 works on Windows Server 2019 Standard. Built-in node works after n8n-nodes-ldap@0.1.10  node unistall.

But in prod environment only n8n-nodes-ldap@0.1.10 works on Windows Server 2022 Standard.
